me on easy mode or accept the challenges of medium or hard difficulties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the in-game encyclopedia in order to take advantage of the knowledge about enemies and buildings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use headphones for engaging audio experience included original music and sound design. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the awesome hand painted levels and catchy cartoon animations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay that will hook you in the human body for hours and hours!</p></li></ul>",
