                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a tower defense game from 2015, in both great and awful ways that summarizes it well enough, it copies somethings from the greats of hero units, meta upgrades and a level select hub but there are fun moments with the concept of cells at work meets some level of kingdom rush. Most of the play time in games like this comes from the achievements needing a specific level for something that would not be gotten in main gameplay but is a nice bonus if you are willing to burn it",
